+4. Checkpoint resume:
+ - Use ops/dl/production/checkpoint_resume.py at container startup to fetch latest checkpoint from S3 if present.
+
+5. Autoscaler policies:
+ - Configure min/max capacities and consolidate cost-critical jobs to spot pools.
