*** Add File:README_RT_FORMAL_CERT_NPU.md
+RT / Formal / Controller Certification / NPU / Distributed DL - Summary & Operator Steps
+
+1) RT iterative validation
+ - Run .github/workflows/rt_iterative_run.yml (self-hosted) or ops/robotics/rt/lab_validation/iterative_rt_validator.sh locally.
+ - Iterates up to configured attempts until p99 and safe-stop SLOs pass. Collects signed bundles and records evidence.
+
+2) Formal completeness
+ - Run Apalache on TLA+ specs (ops/formal/*). If counterexamples exist, run ops/formal/apalache_issue_creator.py to open a GH issue with artifacts for engineers and reviewers.
+ - Iterate on the model, controllers, or environment constraints and re-run until Apalache reports no problematic counterexamples.
+
+3) Controller certification (HIL)
+ - Use contact injection (ops/robotics/control/certified/contact_injection_tool.py), waveform capture/compare, and run the certification playbook (ops/robotics/control/certified/certification_playbook.md).
+ - Package and sign HIL bundles and submit to third-party certifier.
+
+4) NPU vendor integration
+ - Run .github/workflows/npu_vendor_smoke.yml on appropriate self-hosted runners to validate Inferentia/Graphcore/Habana runtimes.
+ - Add vendor-specific compile & sample model runs to CI builder pipelines and require cosign signatures produced from those runners.
+
+5) Distributed production hardening
+ - Use checkpoint_resume.py and spot_preemption_handler.sh to handle preemptible node behavior.
+ - Integrate job manifests with autoscaler provisioner labels (see ops/dl/production/karpenter_integration.md).
+ - Add mixed precision / gradient accumulation templates to training images for stable long-run training.
+
+6) Carbon gating operationalization
+ - Store WattTime key as secret and run carbon checks (ops/carbon/promotion_gate_carbon_check.py) in CI promotion gates.
+ - Allow operator-signed approval overrides (approval artifacts signed with cosign) when blocking would be unacceptable.
+
+Operator responsibilities
+ - Provide self-hosted runners with appropriate labels (gpu, inferentia, graphcore, habana).
+ - Provide COSIGN_KMS_URI, REKOR_SERVER, WATTTIME_API_KEY secrets in CI and runner env.
+ - Run iterative HIL campaigns and resolve formal counterexamples; maintain evidence bundle for auditors.
+
